      "writtenOn": "2019-11-14T22:15:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m concerned we may get off into the weeds of \"qualifying TCPC chips\" instead of \"qualifying TCPMv2\".\n\nWiring up a Sweetberry might be difficult and would require support of the Power team. And which TCPC do we wish to vet for TCPMv2?\n\nI suggest instead a simple test for PS8751 which is POR:\n\nTest PS8751: Run i2cscan, then i2cxfer r 8 \u003cbus\u003e \u003caddr\u003e 0x1D\nPass: I2C error noted in console (means sleeping)\nFail: Value is returned\n\nTest ANX3429: (????)\n(Can you propose a method to verify this nondestructively?)\n\nPlease feel free to suggest a platform/variant to qualify and which TCPC you\u0027d like to see tested. I will try to follow up.",
