      "message": "I attempted following Aseda\u0027s recommendation to use \"pwr_avg\" command, but was blocked due to (a) readings being swamped by plain on power (b) b/142033952 preventing Suzy-Q use.\n\nHowever I did verify (documented at crbug.com/1022217 ) that the proper LPM states are being entered and exited using DRP dock and \"pd trysrc 0\" command to test Try.SRC and non-Try.SRC DRP resolution in both states.\n\nRole States\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\nTry.SRC Enabled/Disabled\nDRP -- latch as SRC\nDRP -- latch as SNK\n\nPower States\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\nS0\n\nDUT Power State\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\nDUT with charger\n\n\nDUT Properties\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\nVconn-enabled  DUT",
